stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Disconnected
    Disconnected --> Connecting
    Connecting --> Authenticating
    Authenticating --> Synchronizing
    Synchronizing --> Live
    Live --> Disconnected: network loss
    Synchronizing --> Replaying: cursor available
    Replaying --> Live
    Synchronizing --> Snapshot: gap or epoch change
    Snapshot --> Live
    Connecting --> Backoff: transient failure
    Backoff --> Connecting
    Authenticating --> Terminal: revoked or unsupported
